# Gitignored files copied into an `isolation: worktree` agent checkout.
#
# A worktree is a fresh checkout, so anything gitignored is absent. Without this the
# gates fail inside a worktree for the wrong reason: check_rls_coverage.py load_dotenv()s
# the root .env, and DbSettings/ApiSettings both resolve env_file=".env" relative to the
# repo root, so alembic and verify_demo_path.sh get the built-in localhost defaults
# instead of DATABASE_URL/DIRECT_URL.
#
# Only what a gate needs to run. packages/db/.env is a pre-migration Prisma leftover --
# nothing reads it any more (grep: no references outside settings.json's deny list).
.env
